WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.720
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a Korean action comedy film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:11.840
called “Justice High”. Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.480
At the beginning of the movie, a high school&nbsp;
girl named Jenny is walking down the hallway&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:25.760
as students cheer for her. Jenny is short-tempered&nbsp;
and cannot take it when people bully the ones who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:30.400
are weaker than them. She has recently beaten&nbsp;
up some guys for the same reason and has been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.120
suspended for getting into too many fights.&nbsp;
The guys stop her outside the school but are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:41.040
too scared to anger her. They simply ask her to&nbsp;
keep her promise and never return to the school.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:46.400
Jenny’s father Brack is a black belt in&nbsp;
Karate who owns a Judo training institution.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.440
Because of his influence, she has been trained in&nbsp;
several forms of martial arts from a young age.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:55.360
This is also the reason why she never&nbsp;
loses when she fights with the bullies. 
&nbsp;

00:00:55.360 --> 00:01:00.400
The father and daughter go to a new school to be&nbsp;
transferred. The teacher accepts Jenny’s admission&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:05.520
but asks her to attend the school only after&nbsp;
a week because of the mid-term examinations.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:10.800
She also warns Jenny against fighting because&nbsp;
only last week, a bully was suspended for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.760
violent behavior. Her father explains that&nbsp;
Jenny isn’t a bully, in contrast, she likes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:21.040
to fight the bullies because they torture the&nbsp;
weaker ones. After the meeting, Jenny is annoyed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:25.920
at her father for telling the teacher about her&nbsp;
past. Brack explains that there are bound to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:31.440
bullies in the new school as well, hence, Jenny&nbsp;
must learn to have patience and compromise. 
&nbsp;

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:37.360
Outside the school premises, a group of students&nbsp;
is beating up a guy named Alex because he refused&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:42.880
to let them cheat off his paper in the test. Jenny&nbsp;
films a video of the commotion but is spotted by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:47.760
one of the guys in the process. She initially&nbsp;
wants to take the bullying to the principal and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:53.120
solve it the right way. However, when the girls&nbsp;
threaten to beat her up, she resorts to her old&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:59.280
ways. She dodges their attack efficiently and&nbsp;
fights them with little to no effort. Alex is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:05.600
stunned to see someone so brave and powerful. 
A week later is Jenny’s first day at school. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:10.720
guys who were beaten up by her are also in her&nbsp;
class. They turn around, trying to avoid her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:15.760
embarrassed by the fact that they were defeated by&nbsp;
a girl. Jenny notices that Alex is also one of her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:21.200
classmates. He is delighted to meet her again and&nbsp;
tries to start a conversation but Jenny ignores&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:27.040
him. After school, he approaches her and thanks&nbsp;
her for saving him. In turn, Jenny orders him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:32.400
stay away from her if he is really thankful. 
In the following scene, we see Alex’s mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:37.520
serving a mean customer in their restaurant.&nbsp;
The man is drunk and refuses to pay for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:42.480
food. When he shoves her to the ground,&nbsp;
Alex steps up to help his mother. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:48.240
the customer gets aggressive and hits him as&nbsp;
well. In the end, he walks away without paying.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:53.520
Alex’s father died a few years ago after which&nbsp;
they have been getting such customers quite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:58.560
often. Since they cannot defend themselves, the&nbsp;
mother and son are often physically abused. 
&nbsp;

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:03.680
The next day at school, a popular senior girl&nbsp;
named Shannon stops Jenny in the hallways&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:08.960
and asks for her phone. She wants to delete the&nbsp;
video of her friends bullying Alex the other day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:15.360
When Jenny refuses, Shannon raises her hand to&nbsp;
slap her. But Jenny, with her fast reflexes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:20.080
catches it and shoves her to the floor. By&nbsp;
the end of it, Shannon is left humiliated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:25.760
in front of everyone. Later that day, Alex&nbsp;
approaches Jenny again and asks her to teach&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:30.880
him to fight. At first, she is reluctant but when&nbsp;
he reveals that he wants to protect his mother,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:36.000
she brings him to her father’s Judo class. Brack&nbsp;
makes him fill up a form and invites him to join&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:41.360
the class starting the next day. He even hands&nbsp;
Jenny some money for bringing a new student.
&nbsp;

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:45.280
Then, we are introduced to the president&nbsp;
of the school’s student council,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:49.760
Ron. The principal praises him for&nbsp;
handling his position well. But in reality,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:55.040
all the bullies of the schools are Ron’s minions.&nbsp;
He supports them and saves them when things get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.040 --> 00:04:00.240
out of hand. Ron is looking to join a local gang&nbsp;
soon. He is best friends with a guy named Harry.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:04.720
They have known each other since their childhood.&nbsp;
The friends started to fight people as a form of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:10.080
self-defense but lately, Ron has changed. Harry&nbsp;
doesn’t like hitting and mugging the students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:15.360
for no reason which has caused a rift in their&nbsp;
relationship. One day, they are in Ron’s office&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:20.480
when Shannon comes in complaining about Jenny. She&nbsp;
wants them to teach her a lesson for humiliating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:26.880
her. The three are in a love triangle where Ron&nbsp;
likes Shanon but she likes Harry. The guys promise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:32.640
to punish Jenny for disrespecting Shanon. 
After school, Alex goes to the Judo class. Only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:38.000
a minute into the training, he realizes that it&nbsp;
isn’t going to be easy. He is made to do push-ups,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:43.120
skip, and stretch to the best of his ability.&nbsp;
Jenny keeps him company and trains with him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:47.760
forcing him to do better. Alex is so sore&nbsp;
from the practice that he can barely walk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:52.720
to school the next day. Jenny makes fun of him,&nbsp;
saying that it will get tougher with time. 
&nbsp;

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:58.240
During the break between classes, two guys call&nbsp;
Jenny to Ron’s office. She meets Ron and Harry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:02.640
and realizes that they have called her because&nbsp;
of her dispute with Shannon. Even though they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:08.400
powerful seniors, Jenny isn’t intimidated by them&nbsp;
to the least, which piques Harry’s interest. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:13.520
asked why she shoved Shannon, she confidently&nbsp;
answers that she was only defending herself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:18.480
She also tells them about the four students who&nbsp;
were ganged up against Alex. Ron is infuriated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:24.080
by her behavior but Harry asks her to apologize.&nbsp;
She does so and leaves, even though it is clear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:30.240
that she doesn’t mean it. Because Harry cut his&nbsp;
words, Ron tries to call him out but is dismissed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:35.360
Although Ron is the president, people respect&nbsp;
Harry more than him, much to his annoyance.
&nbsp;

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:40.240
Then, we see Alex and Jenny in the Judo class.&nbsp;
Alex thinks it is strange that she doesn’t have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:47.760
any friends even though she is smart, beautiful,&nbsp;
and strong. Jenny answers that letting people into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:52.880
her life will only give them the power to walk&nbsp;
out of it. Alex in turn says that the memories&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:58.320
will stay even though people leave. Jenny is&nbsp;
touched by his words but doesn’t express it. 
&nbsp;

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:03.360
In the evening, Ron, Shannon, Harry, and their&nbsp;
group go to a restaurant to welcome Kris,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:09.040
the guy who was suspended for bullying. They&nbsp;
drink, smoke, and have fun, except Harry who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:14.240
doesn’t feel comfortable talking about beating&nbsp;
people up. At the party, Ron is clearly jealous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:19.360
that Shannon likes Harry instead of him. When&nbsp;
he and Harry are alone, he reveals that he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:24.880
joining a gang. He has already met the leader&nbsp;
but is yet to pay money to get in. Harry calmly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:29.840
tells him that it is not a good idea but when he&nbsp;
doesn’t listen, they get into an altercation. 
&nbsp;

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:34.720
The next day at school, a gangster named&nbsp;
Tay comes to meet Ron. He threatens to pay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:39.760
the entrance fee as soon as possible. Tay is&nbsp;
more powerful than all of his minions combined&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:45.120
so Ron is cautious around him. Although Ron&nbsp;
is dying to be in the gang, Tay wants Harry to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:50.640
join them. He knows what Harry is capable of and&nbsp;
even offers to excuse the entrance fee for him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:56.480
However, Harry tells him off and walks away. 
When Tay leaves, Ron is angered and in the mood to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.480 --> 00:07:02.480
hit someone. Coincidently, he chooses Alex and&nbsp;
asks Kris to bring him to the office. Two boys&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:07.840
approach Alex and terrorize him to come with&nbsp;
them. Harry stops them and asks them to refuse&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:13.280
Ron’s orders. Kris sees this and beats Harry up&nbsp;
for trying to act like he is higher than Ron.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:19.040
Just then, Jenny arrives and asks Alex to come&nbsp;
to Judo class quickly. When Kris stops her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:24.480
she beats him up. Harry is in shock to see that&nbsp;
she can fight better than him. He finds her even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:28.960
more attractive than he did earlier. 
Later, he asks Alex to take him to Brack’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:34.000
Judo class and enrolls to train with Alex and&nbsp;
Jenny. On his first day, she asks him why he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:38.960
is being nice to them when he is also a part of&nbsp;
the bullies. Harry claims that he has left that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:44.240
group and wants to learn to defend himself. 
The next day, Shannon and Jenny bump into each&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:48.400
other on the stairs. Shannon calls her out for&nbsp;
not wishing her a good morning even though she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:53.680
is a senior. Harry interrupts them and asks&nbsp;
Jenny to go to her class. An angered Shannon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:58.960
questions him why he has been so distant lately.&nbsp;
She confesses her love to him and complains about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:03.760
him not picking up her calls. Harry, however,&nbsp;
clearly tells her that she is only a friend. 
&nbsp;

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:10.080
That evening, Jenny and Harry are alone in the&nbsp;
class when she asks him about his true intentions.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:14.880
He mentions that he used to box when he was in&nbsp;
middle school and wants to continue his training.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:18.720
Knowing that he used to be a bully,&nbsp;
Jenny decides to teach him a lesson and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:24.000
challenges him to a boxing match. Initially, Harry&nbsp;
tries to intimidate her but cannot make a single&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:29.200
hit. She defeats him easily and tells him that&nbsp;
power without justice is merely violence. 
&nbsp;

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:35.120
In the following scene, Ron gets a call from Tay&nbsp;
who pressures him to hand in the entrance money.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:40.160
Starting that day, Ron and his minions threaten&nbsp;
and terrorize the kids in the school to collect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:45.040
money. Alex sees them troubling one of his&nbsp;
classmates and tries to stop the bullies. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:50.160
he is still not trained enough to overpower&nbsp;
them, hence, they beat him up. That evening,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:54.240
he goes to judo class and tells Brack&nbsp;
everything that is happening in school. 
&nbsp;

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:58.480
The scene is followed by a montage of&nbsp;
Alex and Harry working hard to train.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:02.960
They form a healthy competition between each&nbsp;
other which helps them even more. One day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:08.240
Brack goes to another town for work, leaving the&nbsp;
kids on their own. They go to the movies and then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:13.680
to the arcade and have a lot of fun. Following&nbsp;
that, Harry takes them to his favorite place which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:19.280
happens to be Alex’s mother’s restaurant. She is&nbsp;
overjoyed that her son finally has friends.
&nbsp;

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:24.720
On their way back home, Harry and Jenny stop by&nbsp;
a grocery store. While talking, Harry reveals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:29.680
that his boxing teacher used to physically abuse&nbsp;
him every day. It took him two years to get out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:34.320
of the toxic environment. He was sad and lonely&nbsp;
when he became friends with people who were a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:39.920
bad influence. Jenny understands that he is trying&nbsp;
to change and is ready to help him in the process.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:44.480
The next day at school, Harry asks Ron what he&nbsp;
is up to. Ron reveals that he has finally paid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:49.200
the gang leader and has joined them. Starting&nbsp;
tomorrow, he is going to work under them and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:54.080
hence, the gang will be ruling the entire&nbsp;
school. Harry is furious at his friend and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:58.480
asks him to change his decision. The two get&nbsp;
into an argument which turns into a physical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.480 --> 00:10:04.000
fight in no time. An angered Ron threatens to&nbsp;
hurt Jenny, knowing that Harry likes her. 
&nbsp;

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:09.040
Later, Ron asks Shannon to help him capture Jenny&nbsp;
in turn for him, helping her to get with Harry.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:13.520
While Jenny is in the classroom, she gets a text&nbsp;
from Shannon who calls her to the student council&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:18.720
office. On reaching there, she is served a&nbsp;
drugged tea. Shannon apologizes to her for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:23.920
everything she has done till now. When Jenny is&nbsp;
about to drink the tea, Shannon pushes it away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:29.280
realizing what she is doing is wrong. Ron barges&nbsp;
in and slaps Shannon in the face for not going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:34.960
through with the plan. Then, Kris traps Jenny in&nbsp;
a headlock and Ron throws a few punches at her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:38.240
She struggles to breathe in the&nbsp;
hold and cannot defend herself. 
&nbsp;

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:43.280
Somewhere else, Alex overhears the bullies&nbsp;
in his class talking about Ron and Jenny.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:48.320
He realizes that she is in trouble and runs&nbsp;
to tell Harry. Harry calls Ron who asks him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:53.120
to come to the school if he wants to save her.&nbsp;
On reaching the school’s auditorium, Harry and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:57.760
Alex are surrounded by Kris and his minions.&nbsp;
The bullies attack them, but this time, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:02.800
two are trained to defend themselves. They get hit&nbsp;
quite a lot of time but by the end of the fight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:07.360
they manage to defeat all of the bullies. 
After that, they rush to the student council&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:13.200
office and see Ron has tied up Jenny to a chair.&nbsp;
He threatens to kill her if the guys come closer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:18.720
or try to call the police. He then makes Harry&nbsp;
kneel in front of him and kicks him repeatedly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:23.200
Alex steps forward and attacks him using one&nbsp;
of the tricks he was taught by Brack. 
&nbsp;

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:29.280
However, Ron overpowers him eventually. By now,&nbsp;
Jenny has managed to free herself and is ready to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:35.280
fight Ron. He might be stronger than the guys but&nbsp;
in comparison to Jenny, he is only a mere bully.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:41.600
She showers him with attacks and beats him easily.&nbsp;
In the last scene, we see that Brack’s judo class&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:46.960
has several women trainees learning self-defense.&nbsp;
Alex and Jenny wait for their turn while Harry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:51.760
is enrolling a teenager in the class. 
